   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Greetings,<div><br></div><div>I am working on my first Shiny app, so please bear with me:<br><br>I went through the helpful tutorial for building a basic Shiny application. I understand that generating a plot can be isolated using an actionButton. But is it also possible to isolate a reactive expression, which merely calculates a value, using the action button?</div><div><br></div><div>For example, the following is clear</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"padding:8.5px;font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.025px;color:rgb(51,51,51);border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;margin-bottom:9px;line-height:18px;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.14902)\"><code style=\"font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;color:inherit;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">output</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">nthValue</span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">&lt;-</span></span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">renderText</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">{</span></span>\r\n  <span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">if</span></span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">goButton</span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">==</span></span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,205)\">0</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span>\r\n    <span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">return</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span>\r\n\r\n  <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">isolate</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">{</span></span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fib</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">as.numeric</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">n</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span>\r\n<span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><div><br></div><div>But if we had wrapped the expression above in reactive(), and then linked another reactive expression to it, only to be executed upon the press of actionButton? Thanks.</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"padding:8.5px;font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.025px;border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;margin-bottom:9px;line-height:18px;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.14902)\"><code style=\"font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fib</span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">&lt;-</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">function</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">n</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ifelse</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">n</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">&lt;</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,205)\">3</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\">,</span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,205)\">1</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\">,</span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fib</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">n</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,205)\">1</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">+</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fib</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">n</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,205)\">2</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\">\r\n\r\n</font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">function</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:inherit\">,</span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">output</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">{</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\">\r\n  </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">currentFib</span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">&lt;-</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">reactive</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">{</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fib</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">as.numeric</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">n</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">}</span><span><font color=\"#687687\">)\r\n</font></span></span></code><code style=\"font-size:12.025px;font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\">  isolate({\r\n  if(actionButton==0)\r\n  return()</font><font color=\"#687687\">\r\n</font>  </code><code style=\"font-size:12.025px;font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\">finalFib&lt;- reactive({ </font><font color=\"#0000ff\">1</font><font color=\"#000000\"> / currentFib })\r\n  })</font></code></pre></div></div>"
    ]
