   "subject": "Re: Isolating a reactive expression to execute only when the actionButton is pressed",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks to both of you, Joe and Ricardo. It is apparent that I am still getting familiar with Shiny, and my concepts are developing (hence the &#39;bi-directional&#39; question :) ). But you have addressed both aspects of the question, and I&#39;m thankful.<div><br></div><div>Cheers!</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Monday, September 16, 2013 6:08:01 AM UTC+1, Joe Cheng [RStudio] wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Your question and your code sample seem to point in two different directions. I&#39;ll give you solutions for both:<div><br></div><div>1) A reactive expression that is only calculated upon the press of actionButton (i.e. its value will always be NULL until actionButton is clicked):</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>currentFib &lt;- reactive({</div><div>  if (actionButton == 0)</div><div>    return()</div><div>  isolate({</div><div>    fib(as.numeric(input$n))</div><div>  })</div><div>})</div><div><br></div><div>\r\n2) Assigning a non-reactive variable only when a button is pressed:</div>\r\n<div><br></div><div>observe({</div><div>  if (actionButton == 0)</div><div>    return()</div><div>  isolate({</div><div>    finalFib &lt;&lt;- reactive({ 1 / fib(as.numeric(input$n)) })</div><div>  })</div><div>})</div><div>\r\n\r\n<br></div><div>Hopefully between those examples there&#39;s something that can help you...?</div></div><div><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Sat, Sep 14, 2013 at 3:52 AM, R-seekeR <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">scac...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Greetings,<div><br></div><div>I am working on my first Shiny app, so please bear with me:<br><br>I went through the helpful tutorial for building a basic Shiny application. I understand that generating a plot can be isolated using an actionButton. But is it also possible to isolate a reactive expression, which merely calculates a value, using the action button?</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>For example, the following is clear</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"padding:8.5px;font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.025px;color:rgb(51,51,51);border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;margin-bottom:9px;line-height:18px;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.14902)\"><code style=\"font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;color:inherit;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">output</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">nthValue</span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">&lt;-</span></span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">renderText</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">{</span></span>\r\n  <span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">if</span></span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">goButton</span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">==</span></span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,205)\">0</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span>\r\n    <span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">return</span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span>\r\n\r\n  <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">isolate</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">{</span></span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fib</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">as.numeric</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">n</span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span> <span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span>\r\n<span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><div><br></div><div>But if we had wrapped the expression above in reactive(), and then linked another reactive expression to it, only to be executed upon the press of actionButton? Thanks.</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div><pre style=\"padding:8.5px;font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.025px;border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;margin-bottom:9px;line-height:18px;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.14902)\"><code style=\"font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"><span>fib</span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">&lt;-</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">function</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span>n</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span>ifelse</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span>n</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">&lt;</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,205)\">3</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\">,</span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,205)\">1</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\">,</span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span>fib</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span>n</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,205)\">1</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">+</span></span><span>fib</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span>n</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,205)\">2</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\">\r\n\r\n</font><span>shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">function</span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span>input</span><span style=\"color:inherit\">,</span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span>output</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">{</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\">\r\n  </font><span>currentFib</span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">&lt;-</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span>reactive</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">{</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span>fib</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span>as.numeric</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span><span>input</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">$</span></span><span>n</span><span style=\"color:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span><font color=\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\"> </font><span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">}</span><span><font color=\"#687687\">)\r\n</font></span></span></code><code style=\"font-size:12.025px;font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\">  isolate({\r\n  if(actionButton==0)\r\n  return()</font><font color=\"#687687\">\r\n</font>  </code><code style=\"font-size:12.025px;font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\">finalFib&lt;- reactive({ </font><font color=\"#0000ff\">1</font><font color=\"#000000\"> / currentFib })\r\n  })</font></code></pre></div></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are